- T101 实际交付 `internal/diagnostics/leak_scan_test.go` 四例（`_LeakScanEventPayload` / `_LeakScanAttrsWhitelist` / `_LeakScanAuditRef` / `_LeakScanReadPath`）；`export_resume_test.go` **不创建**。
